NORA VieNeu Rust host

The control algorithms in src/heads.rs, src/prompt.rs, src/sampling.rs and
src/onnx.rs are modified Rust translations/adaptations of the VieNeu-TTS v3
Turbo CPU reference by Pham Nguyen Ngoc Bao and upstream contributors.
The original source is licensed under Apache License 2.0; a copy is included
as LICENSE-APACHE. Modifications include bounded loading/admission, Rust
tokenization/sampling/state ownership, explicit cancellation/errors, streaming
callbacks, and lazy codec session selection. NORA is not affiliated with or
endorsed by the upstream author. Upstream code/weight/data licenses remain
separate; this crate includes no model weights or voices.

